cter/classes/paladin.html) | [Halfling](./character/races/halfling.html) | | | [Ranger](./character/classes/ranger.html) | [Human](./character/races/human.html) | | | [Rogue](./character/classes/rogue.html) | [Tiefling](./character/races/tiefling.html) | | | [Sorcerer](./character/classes/sorcerer.html) | | | | [Warlock](./character/classes/warlock.html) | | | | [Wizard](./character/classes/wizard.html) | | ## Combat | **Combat** | ****| |:---:|:---:| | [Actions in Combat](./combat/actions_in_combat.html) | [Mounted Combat](./combat/mounted_combat.html) | | [Cover](./combat/cover.html) | [Movement and Position](./combat/movement_and_position.html) | | [Damage and Healing](./combat/damage_and_healing.html) | [Order of Combat](./combat/order_of_combat.html) | | [Making an Attack](./combat/making_an_attack.html) | [Underwater Combat](./combat/underwater_combat.html) | ## Rules | **Rules** | **Rules \- Abilities** | |:---:|:---:| | [Advantage and Disadvantage](./rules/advantage_and_disadvantage.html) | [Ability Checks](./rules/abilities/ability_checks.html) | | [Conditions](./rules/conditions.html) | [Ability Scores](./rules/abilities/ability_scores.html) | | [Expenses](./rules/expenses.html) | [Saving Throws](./rules/abilities/saving_throws.html) | | [Feats](./rules/feats.html) | [Charisma](./rules/abilities/charisma.html) | | [Inspiration](./rules/inspiration.html) | [Constitution](./rules/abilities/constitution.html) | | [Leveling Up](./rules/leveling_up.html) | [Dexterity](./rules/abilities/dexterity.html) | | [Multiclassing](./rules/multiclassing.html) | [Intelligence](./rules/abilities/intelligence.html) | | [Proficiency Bonus](./rules/proficiency_bonus.html) | [Strength](./rules/abilities/strength.html) | | | [Wisdom](./rules/abilities/wisdom.html) | ## GM Rules | **GM Rules** | **GM Rules \- Magic Item Indexes** | **GM Rules \- Monster Indexes** | |:---:|:---:|:---:| | [Diseases](./gamemaster_rules/diseases.html) | [Items by Name](./gamemaster_rules/magic_item_i